{"1340720": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "State of Decay 3", "steam_appid": 1340720, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Community is Survival</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The zombie apocalypse nearly wiped out humankind. Years after the initial outbreak, carve out a life for yourself in a world gripped by blood plague. Play as a community of survivors, build up your settlements with friends, and destroy zombies in State of Decay 3, the latest in the franchise from developer Undead Labs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1340720/extras/d31158547ceca9d8ae512bfddd7ac2bb.poster.avif?t=1780854541\" width=1170 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1340720/extras/d31158547ceca9d8ae512bfddd7ac2bb.webm?t=1780854541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1340720/extras/d31158547ceca9d8ae512bfddd7ac2bb.mp4?t=1780854541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Push Back Against a New Threat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   • Equilibrium has been broken. A new zombie evolution threatens to take over the landscape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   • Reclaim territory, scavenge, build, and fight to create safety for your community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Choices Matter</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   • It's your story - make tough decisions about where to live, what to build, and who to recruit into your community</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   • Permadeath is an ever-present danger to your community: Every risk must be weighed against the reward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1340720/extras/c188eba46b8465dd9661b74882bfa1c3.poster.avif?t=1780854541\" width=1170 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1340720/extras/c188eba46b8465dd9661b74882bfa1c3.webm?t=1780854541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1340720/extras/c188eba46b8465dd9661b74882bfa1c3.mp4?t=1780854541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expand and Thrive</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   • Claim multiple settlements to create a community network.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   • Build to survive. Reinforce defenses, expand your arsenal, craft homemade explosives, and heal injured characters to boost morale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   • Discover enclaves of survivors, build trust, and recruit them to your community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive and Build with Your Friends</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   • Online multiplayer mode with up to four people brings you a new, shared world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   • Start a community together from scratch and combine your strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   • Develop and expand a shared community that reflects your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1340720/extras/5e47915de67ddb9030b9e5cafcf4e00b.poster.avif?t=1780854541\" width=1170 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1340720/extras/5e47915de67ddb9030b9e5cafcf4e00b.webm?t=1780854541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1340720/extras/5e47915de67ddb9030b9e5cafcf4e00b.mp4?t=1780854541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Continue Your Legacy</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   • Future content will unlock new features and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online console multiplayer requires a platform-specific subscription that includes online multiplayer (sold separately).</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Community is Survival</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The zombie apocalypse nearly wiped out humankind. Years after the initial outbreak, carve out a life for yourself in a world gripped by blood plague. Play as a community of survivors, build up your settlements with friends, and destroy zombies in State of Decay 3, the latest in the franchise from developer Undead Labs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1340720/extras/d31158547ceca9d8ae512bfddd7ac2bb.poster.avif?t=1780854541\" width=1170 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1340720/extras/d31158547ceca9d8ae512bfddd7ac2bb.webm?t=1780854541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1340720/extras/d31158547ceca9d8ae512bfddd7ac2bb.mp4?t=1780854541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Push Back Against a New Threat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   • Equilibrium has been broken. A new zombie evolution threatens to take over the landscape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   • Reclaim territory, scavenge, build, and fight to create safety for your community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Choices Matter</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   • It's your story - make tough decisions about where to live, what to build, and who to recruit into your community</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   • Permadeath is an ever-present danger to your community: Every risk must be weighed against the reward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1340720/extras/c188eba46b8465dd9661b74882bfa1c3.poster.avif?t=1780854541\" width=1170 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1340720/extras/c188eba46b8465dd9661b74882bfa1c3.webm?t=1780854541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1340720/extras/c188eba46b8465dd9661b74882bfa1c3.mp4?t=1780854541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expand and Thrive</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   • Claim multiple settlements to create a community network.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   • Build to survive. Reinforce defenses, expand your arsenal, craft homemade explosives, and heal injured characters to boost morale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   • Discover enclaves of survivors, build trust, and recruit them to your community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive and Build with Your Friends</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   • Online multiplayer mode with up to four people brings you a new, shared world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   • Start a community together from scratch and combine your strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   • Develop and expand a shared community that reflects your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1340720/extras/5e47915de67ddb9030b9e5cafcf4e00b.poster.av